# The Debian archive marks trixie-backports NotAutomatic, so that nothing comes
# from it unless asked for. The mirror fai-cd puts on the ISO does not, and
# every package there would follow its backports version. Restore the archive
# behaviour: only the packages listed with release=trixie-backports (the kernel
# of the cluster nodes) come from backports, and they keep following it.
Package: *
Pin: release n=trixie-backports
Pin-Priority: 100
